---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: Services — AIVANCE
metaTitle: Services — AIVANCE
metaDescription: "Three service areas, one partner: Visibility, Software & Systems, Automation. Overview of all services offered by the digital agency AIVANCE."
breadcrumb: Services
permalink: /en/leistungen/
deUrl: /leistungen/
---

<section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Services</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Three areas, one partner</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed">Each area works on its own — together they spare you the coordination of multiple vendors.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 space-y-8">
    {% for cluster in clusters %}
    {% set cd = cluster.en %}
    <div class="reveal grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-8">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">{{ cd.claim or cluster.claim }}</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">{{ cd.title or cluster.title }}</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-5">{{ cd.heroSatz or cluster.heroSatz }}</p>
        <a href="/en/leistungen/{{ cluster.slug }}/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors">View area →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {% for serviceSlug in cluster.services %}
        {% set service = services | findBySlug(serviceSlug) %}
        {% set sd = service.en %}
        <a href="/en/leistungen/{{ service.slug }}/" class="block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-5 shadow-card hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">{{ sd.title or service.title }}</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">{{ sd.card or service.card }}</p>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/leitplanken.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
